  "historyNote": "#2038, eff 7-1-82; ss by #2711, eff 5-16-84; ss by #5130, eff 5-1-91, EXPIRED: 5-1-97 New. #8445, eff 10-6-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13 New. #12193, eff 5-26-17",
